n or having failure points it  is difficult to identify where those  failure points are and how to solve them  chef resolves this issue and it does so  by turning  the environment that you're managing  with hardware and software into code and  once you have it written as code you're  able to then test that code  chef itself is made up of a number of  key components as a system administrator  you work on your desktop at your  workstation and you create recipes those  recipes are then bundled together into a  cookbook and that cookbook communicates  with the server the main chef server and  the node of servers within your  environment and knife is the tool that  does that communication oh hi and the  chef client on the various nodes service  will communicate back to the chef server  what the standards and the environment  are so that they can provide a two-way  communication to validate that the  system has been set up and is being  maintained to the same standards as  defined by the individual recipes as an  architect and working in this chef  environment it makes it much easier for  you to be able to control the entire  system administration instead of having  many people having to work on all the  servers you can now have one person  controlling hundreds of servers  simultaneously and a polum have been  able to prove conclusively that chef is  a tool that can help improve the  consistent experience of working with  hardware so I hope you enjoyed our quick  class today  this is Matthew with simply learn and  signing up if you have any additional  questions reach out to us in the  comments below and we'll get back to you  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simple learn YouTube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos to nerd up and get certified  click here

